      "writtenOn": "2020-01-17T23:32:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "new_variant.py does a lot more than just copying the EC files. If this documentation will only cover the EC, then we should point out platform/dev/contrib/variant/create_initial_ec_image.sh, which will only copy the code for the EC, and nothing else.",
