      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-17T23:54:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let\u0027s clarify that the user will usually call new_variant.py to create the variant in coreboot and EC, plus modify the yaml files, etc. However, for a baseboard that is not yet supported by new_variant.py, the user can call create_initial_ec_image.sh directly just to copy the EC code.",
      "parentUuid": "65301f4e_d2e5d1f6",
